# Potential Dridex Activity | T1033, T1055, T1135 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules-emerging-threats/2019/Malware/Dridex/proc_creation_win_malware_dridex.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 ((Image="*\\svchost.exe" CommandLine="*C:\\Users\\*" CommandLine="*\\Desktop\\*" NOT ParentImage="C:\\Windows\\System32\\*") OR (ParentImage="*\\excel.exe" Image="*\\regsvr32.exe" (CommandLine IN ("* -s *", "*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\*")) NOT CommandLine="*.dll*") OR (ParentImage="*\\svchost.exe" ((Image="*\\whoami.exe" CommandLine="* /all*") OR ((Image IN ("*\\net.exe", "*\\net1.exe")) CommandLine="* view*"))))
